      "starred_repos_count": 29,
      "username": "leo"
    },
    "body": "This does not need an opt-in and should be the default behaviour in host mode if we can guarantee stable dirs via kernel namespaces on Linux. Environments that don't support stable dirs (I assume Windows and maybe MacOS) should be documented.\n\nIdeally the workdir path observed inside the job should be the same in all modes and environments.",
